    "name": "Teya FX Captures DCC API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Teya FX API allows you to fetch the latest exchange rates for currency pairs and perform Dynamic Currency Conversion (DCC). Use this API to verify card eligibility, retrieve real-time exchange rates, and create DCC offers with persisted quotes.",
